{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-capeside-marina-residences","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"capeside-marina-residences-sobha-realty-sobha-siniya-island","about":"Capeside Marina Residences is a project by Sobha located on Siniya Island, featuring two towers with a ground level, nine residential floors, and a roof. The architecture presents a refined waterfront composition defined by fluid lines, expansive terraces, and a harmonious balance between modern form and resort-style elegance. Gently curved façades, layered horizontal bands, and extensive glass surfaces create a light, rhythmic silhouette.The collection includes residences with one, two, and three bedrooms. The interior presents a calm, contemporary living space defined by natural light, refined materials, and a warm, neutral palette. Floor-to-ceiling windows frame expansive sea views, while soft textiles, organic forms, and light wood finishes create an atmosphere of understated elegance.Residents will benefit from the outdoor relaxation areas, retail outlets, lush parks and landscaped gardens, beach access, promenade, and yacht club with boat mooring, evoking a resort-like atmosphere.The location on Siniya Island provides quick access to key destinations. Marjan Island is around 10 minutes away, Sharjah can be reached in about 30 minutes, and Dubai in approximately 50 minutes. The island is connected to the mainland by a bridge, ensuring convenient transportation links.","price":1980000,"title":"Capeside Marina Residences","bitrix":{"id":1422,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":null,"tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Capeside Marina Residences","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Sobha Realty","project_location":"Sobha Siniya Island"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Feature_5c6666822b.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Feature_5c